  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med st&#xf6;det till Forum Syds HIV/AIDS program &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka civila samh&#xe4;llets respons i Botswana genom st&#xf6;d till fyra nationella n&#xe4;tverk:Bostwana Network of AIDS Service Organizations, Botswana Network on Ethics,Law and HIV/AIDS, Botswana Network of People Living with HIV/AIDS och Botswana Council of NGOs. Detta &#xe4;r den strategiska ink&#xf6;rsporten till CBO:er, FBOs och PLHA st&#xf6;dgrupper.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the support to Forum Syd&apos;s HIV/AIDS Programme is to strengthen civil society reponse in Botswana through support to four national networks: Bostwana Network of AIDS Service Organizations, Botswana Network on Ethics,Law and HIV/AIDS, Botswana Network of People Living with HIV/AIDS and Botswana Council of NGOs. This is the strategic entry point to CBOs, FBOs and PLHA support groups.</narrative>
  </description>
